     2	
     3	Contract (LIBS_CHANGES P1, write-receipt-vs-temporal-query): the receipt's
     4	attestation is populated FROM THE COMMITTED ROW, never from "keys exist
     5	locally" inference. A per-observer signer returning None must surface as
     6	signed=False even when signing is configured; conversely two observers under
     7	the SAME configuration must get different attestations when the committed
     8	rows differ — the case that kills any config-inference implementation.
